---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+19195550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(919) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Missing or Damaged Shingles Wake Forest NC" description="Missing or damaged shingles in Wake Forest? Fast replacement to prevent leaks. Licensed local roofers. Call (919) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Missing Shingles</div>
      <h1>Missing or Damaged Shingles</h1>
      <p>Exposed underlayment from missing or curled shingles invites water and wind damage.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>High winds and aging asphalt commonly lift or tear shingles in Wake Forest. We replace damaged sections promptly, matching color and style when possible, and check surrounding areas for hidden wear.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
